**/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Dependencies：所有子项目node_modules
**/node_modules/

# System
.DS_Store
.git/

# Build / Output：任意位置打包产物
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/coverage/
*.local

# Editor
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# TS / Build
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

